---
// Contact destinations from the existing official-site content.
---
<section id="contacto" class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <div class="contact-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="contact-inner">
    <div class="contact-topline"><span>Contacto / El próximo paso</span><span>Santiago del Estero, Argentina</span></div>
    <div class="contact-main">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <h2 id="contact-title">Una idea.<br />Una charla.<br /><span>Algo nuevo.</span></h2>
        <p>Contanos qué tenés en mente.<br />Le damos forma, juntos.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <span class="contact-invitation">Todo empieza con un hablemos.</span>
        <a class="contact-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/543856260410">
          <span class="contact-link-label"><small>Conversemos por WhatsApp</small><span>Hablemos de tu idea</span></span>
          <span class="contact-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:contacto@neuraz.ar"><span><small>O escribinos a</small>contacto@neuraz.ar</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="contact-note">La primera consulta no tiene costo ni compromiso.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <footer class="contact-bottomline">
      <p>Personas reales.<br />Ideas que se hacen.</p>
      <div class="contact-socials"><a href="https://www.behance.net/emilgonzalez" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Behance <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/romina-lescano/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <a class="contact-phone" href="https://wa.me/543856260410">+54 385 626 0410</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .contact-section { position: relative; isolation: isolate; overflow: clip; min-height: 100svh; padding: 48px clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7.5rem) 32px; background: #fafafa; color: #171717; scroll-margin-top: 80px; }
  .contact-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: calc(100svh - 80px); max-width: 1648px; margin-inline: auto; }
  .contact-glow { position: absolute; inset: -20%; pointer-events: none; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 60%, #00000008, transparent 47%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 95%, #00000004, transparent 40%); filter: blur(40px); animation: contact-drift 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  .contact-topline { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #00000021; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #555555; }
  .contact-main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-items: center; flex: 1; padding-block: clamp(70px, 10vh, 140px); }
  h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 7.3vw, 8rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .99; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
  h2 span { color: #ef741d; }
  .contact-copy p { margin-top: 30px; color: #555555; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem); line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-actions { min-width: 0; }
  .contact-invitation { display: block; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #555555; font-size: 12px; }
  .contact-whatsapp { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; min-height: 140px; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; background: #eeeeee; color: #171717; border: 1px solid #00000018; text-decoration: none; transition: background 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease; }
  .contact-link-label { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .contact-link-label small { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .contact-link-label > span { font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.9vw, 1.9rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .contact-arrow { display: grid; place-items: center; flex: none; width: 48px; height: 48px; border: 1px solid #22222233; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 25px; transition: transform 180ms ease; }
  .contact-whatsapp:hover { background: #e5e5e5; transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .contact-whatsapp:hover .contact-arrow { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .contact-email { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 105px; padding: 24px 4px; border-bottom: 1px solid #00000030; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem); letter-spacing: -.025em; text-decoration: none; }
  .contact-email small { display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #555555; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .contact-email > span:last-child { font-size: 26px; }
  .contact-note { margin-top: 22px; color: #555555; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-bottomline { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; padding-top: 26px; border-top: 1px solid #00000021; color: #555555; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-bottomline p { margin: 0; }
  .contact-socials { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
  .contact-socials a { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
  .contact-socials a, .contact-phone { padding-block: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
  a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #171717; outline-offset: 6px; }
  .contact-whatsapp:focus-visible { outline-color: #171717; }
  @keyframes contact-drift { to { transform: translate3d(-4%, -2%, 0) scale(1.1); } }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .contact-section { padding: 32px 26px; }
    .contact-inner { min-height: calc(100svh - 64px); }
    .contact-topline { font-size: 9px; align-items: start; }
    .contact-topline span:last-child { text-align: right; max-width: 120px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .contact-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; padding-block: 60px; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 13vw, 6rem); }
    .contact-copy p { margin-top: 24px; }
    .contact-invitation { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .contact-whatsapp { padding: 23px; min-height: 120px; }
    .contact-bottomline { flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
    .contact-socials { gap: 20px; }
    .contact-socials a { gap: 9px; }
    .contact-phone { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .contact-glow { animation: none; } .contact-whatsapp, .contact-arrow { transition: none; } .contact-whatsapp:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
